# Generated delivery artifact — never a tracked source file, and it must never contain itself
native-sip-daemon.patch

# Zenith harness surface. Generated per-machine by `zenith init` because .mcp.json and
# .codex/config.toml embed the ABSOLUTE path of the local harness checkout — committing them
# would hand another machine a path that does not exist there. Recreate with:
#   uv run --project <zenith>/zenith zenith init --workspace-dir <repo> --agent claude
.mcp.json
.claude/
.codex/
.hermes/
.zenith/
.agents/skills/
